÷4÷Other_Run_Functions÷Other Run Functions÷Open Watcom Integrated Development Environment
îOther_Run_Functions

ìIntegrated Development Environment, running programsì ìrunning programsì In the Open Watcom Integrated Development Environment you can run programs other than the targets in your current project window.  Use the run functions in the Actions menu to specify the program you want to run.  The Run item runs the specified program under your host environment.  The Run Batch item runs the specified program in the IDE Log window.

Ê
ÌTo run other programs in the IDE:
¹ 

Ì(1)
¹ïbï Choose Runğ from the Actions menu.

or

Ì 
